<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWA ICHANDUSO LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">1YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWA ICHANDUSO LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili lwa ichanduso lwa Yohana lwandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Yohana hagatigati ya milao ya 85 na 90 songela kuvumbuka kwa Kilisto. Yohana haitambule mwenyego kamba iyo yandike ulupwilili, ila muisula ya ichanduso yolagusa kamba heyo kamona Yesu kipigiti viyakalile mgima na hata kuzuka kwake (1:1-3). Vija viwandikigwe lupwilili lwa Yohana lwa ichanduso ilinga ng'hani na vija vichandikigwe kitabu cha Usenga Unogile wa Yohana. Yokoneka kamba Yohana kandika Usenga Unogile wa Yohana na zimhwilili ndatu za 1Yohana, 2Yohana, na 3Yohana kipigiti viyakalile yokala Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kandika lupwilili luno ha wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto kipigiti wanhu wamtogole Kilisto viwakalile mumgayo ulawa ha dale da wanhu dikemigwa “Ginostiki.” Wanhu wano wakala watogole kamba Yesu kakala Mulungu kabisa na kamba hakalile munhu yali na lukuli lwa nyama na mulopa kipigiti viyakalile muulumwengu. Mkilamso kino Yohana kokwandika ugima wa Yesu na vija viyamonile na meso gake mwenyego na kamba makono gake mwenyego gamkwasa (1:1-3). Vino vivo vilamso va Yohana kwandika lupwilili luno, kutenda deng'ho jake divikizwe (1:4), abaho kalonda kuwazuila wanhu sambiwatende vilozo (2:1), abaho kuwazuila wanhu wamtogole Kilisto sambiwagatogole mafundo ga uvwizi (2:26), na kuwalongela wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wavitange kamba hewo wakomboligwa (5:13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yohana kolutambuza lupwilili lwake na kulava kilamso cha kwandika lupwilili luno (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho kolongelela vija Mulungu viyali mulangaza na vija vitulondigwa kukala kamba viyakalile Yesu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 1:5-3:10">1:5—3:10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho kotukumbusa ndagizi ya kuinogela wenyego kwa wenyego (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 3:11-5:12">3:11—5:12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Komambukizila lupwilili lwake muisula ya <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 5:13-21">5:13-21</ref></char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli Ilava Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1"/>Tuwapetela munhu yakalile baho songela haichanduso, ayo itumuhulike, ayo itumonile na meso getu wenyego, ayo itumuwene na kumgoga na makono getu, ayo ituwapetele, ayo yali Mbuli ya ugima. <verse eid="1JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2"/>Munhu ino ayo yali ugima, kagubuligwa kumwetu, na tumona. Na sambi tompeta na kuwalongela mweye kamba heyo iyo ugima wa digunge. Kakala na Tata, abaho kagubuligwa kumwetu. <verse eid="1JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3"/>Towapetela mweye kija kituchonile na kukihulika giladi na mweye vivija muilumbe hamoja na tweye. Tweye twa hamoja na Tata na Mwanage Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="1JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4"/>Towandikileni mbuli zino giladi deng'ho jetu divikizwe.<verse eid="1JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Iyo Mulangaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5"/>Uno uwo usenga utuhulike kulawa ha Yesu Kilisto na toupeta kumwenu kamba Mulungu iyo mulangaza na mgati yake mduhu ziza. <verse eid="1JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6"/>Kamba tuhalonga twa hamoja na heyo na kuno totembela mdiziza, tovwiza, na hatutenda gaja gali kweli. <verse eid="1JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7"/>Ila kamba tuhatembela mmulangaza, kamba heyo viyali mmulangaza, tuna uhamoja wa wenyego kwa wenyego, na mulopa wa Yesu, mwanage, wotung'aliza kulawa m'vilozo vose.<verse eid="1JN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8"/>Tuhalonga twabule vilozo, toivwizila wenyego, na mduhu kweli mgati yetu. <verse eid="1JN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9"/>Ila kamba tuhavitogola vilozo vetu haulongozi wa Mulungu, heyo kana kweli na kabule uzenzeleganye na kotugela kumgongo vilozo vetu na kotung'aliza kulawa muuzenzeleganye wose utulinao. <verse eid="1JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10"/>Kamba tuhalonga hatutendile vilozo, tomtenda heyo kuwa m'vwizi, na mbuli yake haili mgati yetu.<verse eid="1JN 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kilisto Iyo Yotutaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1"/>Wanangu, niwandikila gano mweye giladi sambimtende vilozo. Ila munhu yahatenda vilozo, tuna munhu imwe yotugombela ha Tata, iyo Yesu Kilisto yalibule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="1JN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2"/>Heyo iyo nhosa ilavigwe sama ya vilozo vetu, na sio tu sama ya vilozo vetu tweye, ila vivija sama ya vilozo va ulumwengu wose.<verse eid="1JN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3"/>Tuhazitogola ndagizi za Mulungu, tovimanya kamba tumtanga heyo. <verse eid="1JN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4"/>Munhu yolonga, “Nimtanga,” ila hazigoga ndagizi zake, m'vwizi, mduhu kweli mgati yake. <verse eid="1JN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5"/>Ila munhu yoyose yahaitogola mbuli yake, noge da Mulungu dimemezigwa kweli mgati yake. Vino vivo vituitanga kamba twa mgati yake. <verse eid="1JN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6"/>Munhu yoyose yolonga kamba ka mgati ya Mulungu, kolondigwa yakale kamba viyakalile Yesu.<verse eid="1JN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi ya Sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7"/>Wambwiga zangu, siwandikila ndagizi ya sambi ila ndagizi ya umwaka imkalile nayo songela haichanduso. Ndagizi ino ya umwaka iyo usenga umuuhulike. <verse eid="1JN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8"/>Hata avo nowandikila ndagizi ya sambi, na ndagizi hiyo iyo kweli ili mgati yake, na ili mgati yenu, kwavija ziza dobita na mulangaza wa kweli wisha kumulika.<verse eid="1JN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9"/>Munhu yoyose yokiiyona ka mmulangaza na kuno komwihila ndugu yake, munhu iyo kang'hali mdiziza. <verse eid="1JN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10"/>Munhu yoyose yomnogela ndugu yake kokala mmulangaza na haduhu kinhu chochose mgati yake chondakiwe king'hwaso ha ndugu yake. <verse eid="1JN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11"/>Ila munhu yoyose yomwihila ndugu yake ka mdiziza, na kotembela mdiziza. Hakutanga koyochola, kwavija ziza dimgela umbugumbugu.<verse eid="1JN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12"/>Nowandikila mweye wana wadodo, kwavija vilozo venu vigeligwa kumgongo kubitila twaga da Yesu. <verse eid="1JN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13"/>Nowandikila mweye watata, kwavija mumtanga heyo, ayo yakalile baho songela haichanduso. Nowandikila mweye wamhale, kwavija mmuhuma Mwenembago.<verse eid="1JN 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14"/>Nowandikila mweye wana wadodo, kwavija mumtanga Tata. Nowandikila mweye watata, kwavija mumtanga heyo, ayo yakalile baho songela haichanduso. Nowandikila mweye wamhale, kwavija muna mhiko. Mbuli ya Mulungu yokala mgati yenu, na mmuhuma Mwenembago.<verse eid="1JN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15"/>Sambimuunogele ulumwengu ama vinhu vili muulumwengu, kwavija awo wounogela ulumwengu, kumnogela Tata mduhu mgati yao. <verse eid="1JN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16"/>Sulukila ya lukuli na sulukila ya meso na kuitopela ugoli uulinao, vinhu vino vose vivo vinhu va ulumwengu, na havilawa ha Tata, ila volawa muulumwengu. <verse eid="1JN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17"/>Na ulumwengu na sulukila yake yose vobita, ila awo wogatenda goyolonda Mulungu wokala milongo yose.<verse eid="1JN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mdumuka wa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18"/>Mweye wana, sota ya mmabehi. Kamba vumuhulike kamba ayo yom'beza Kilisto kokwiza, avo sambi wabeza Kilisto bwando weza. Sama ya mbuli ino tovitanga kamba sota ya mmabehi. <verse eid="1JN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19"/>Wanhu wano walawa kumwetu, ila hawali wanhu zetu. Kwavija kamba wahawile wanhu zetu, wahasigale hamoja na tweye, ila kusegela kumwao kolagusa kamba mmwanza wao haduhu yali munhu wetu.<verse eid="1JN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20"/>Ila Kilisto kawetila mweye Loho wa Mulungu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kawetila mweye Loho wa Mulungu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kawagwelela mweye Loho wa Mulungu.</char></note> na mweye mose muitanga kweli. <verse eid="1JN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21"/>Nowandikila si kamba hamuitangile kweli, ila kwavija muitanga kweli na m'vitanga kamba haduhu uvwizi ulawa muikweli.<verse eid="1JN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22"/>Yalihi yali m'vwizi? Munhu ija yolonga kamba Yesu sio Kilisto. Munhu kamba hiyo iyo yom'beza Kilisto. Kom'beza Tata na Mwana. <verse eid="1JN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23"/>Kwavija waja wose womulema Mwana vivija womulema Tata, na awo womtogola Mwana vivija womtogola Tata.<verse eid="1JN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24"/>Lekeni kija kimuhulike songela haichanduso kikale mgati yenu. Kamba kija kimuhulike songela haichanduso kihakala mgati yenu, avo na mweye mokala mgati ya Mwana na mgati ya Tata. <verse eid="1JN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25"/>Na kino kicho kituilagane yatugwelele, yatugwelele ugima wa digunge.<verse eid="1JN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26"/>Niwandikileni mweye mbuli zino sama ya awo wogeza kuwagiza mweye. <verse eid="1JN 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27"/>Kumwenu mweye, Loho wa Mulungu iyamwitileni Kilisto ikale mgati yenu, avo hamulonda munhu yoyose yawafundize. Ila loho yake yowafundiza vinhu vose na yowafundiza kweli na si uvwizi. Kamba vija viiwafundize mweye umwaka, kaleni mgati yake.<verse eid="1JN 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28"/>Avo, wana wadodo, kaleni mgati yake giladi yahagubuligwa sambitudumbe na sambitugwe kinyala haulongozi wake kipigiti vondayeze. <verse eid="1JN 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29"/>Kamba muhavitanga kamba heyo kabule uzenzeleganye, movitanga kamba kila munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye kaleligwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="1JN 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Wana wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1"/>Loleni noge kulu kamba dino Tata diyatugwelele tweye, kamba tukemigwe wana wa Mulungu, na vino vivo vituli. Kilamso cha ulumwengu kuleka kututanga tweye icho kino, kwavija haumtangile heyo. <verse eid="1JN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2"/>Wambwiga zangu, sambi twa wana wa Mulungu, na hatunavitanga vija vondatuwe kulawa hano. Ila tuvitanga kamba Kilisto yahalawilila, towa kamba heyo viyali, kwavija tomona kamba viyali. <verse eid="1JN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3"/>Na wanhu wose wali na tamanilo dino kumwake heyo woing'aliza wenyego, wowa kamba heyo viyang'alile.<verse eid="1JN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4"/>Munhu yoyose yotenda vilozo kogakeng'enha Malagizo ga Mulungu, kwavija vilozo nhegulo yake kugakeng'enha Malagizo. <verse eid="1JN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5"/>Mweye m'vitanga kamba Yesu kagubuligwa giladi yavisegeze vilozo, na mmwake heyo mduhu vilozo. <verse eid="1JN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6"/>Haduhu munhu yali mgati yake yogendelela kutenda vilozo, munhu yoyose yogendelela kutenda vilozo hamonile ama hamtangile heyo. <verse eid="1JN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7"/>Mweye wana wadodo, munhu sambiyawavwizile, munhu yoyose yotenda mbuli zilibule uzenzeleganye hiyo kabule uzenzeleganye, kamba Kilisto viyalibule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="1JN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8"/>Kila munhu yotenda vilozo ka mwana wa Mwenembago, kwavija Mwenembago katenda vilozo songela haichanduso. Kilamso cha kugubuligwa Mwana wa Mulungu kikala kuibananga sang'hano ya Mwenembago.<verse eid="1JN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9"/>Awo waleligwe na Mulungu hawatenda vilozo, kwavija mbeyu ya Mulungu yokala mgati yao. Hawatenda vilozo kwavija waleligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="1JN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10"/>Wana wa Mulungu na wana wa Mwenembago waigola mmbuli zino. Waja wose woleka kutenda mbuli zilibule uzenzeleganye na waja woleka kuwanogela ndugu zao hawalawa ha Mulungu.<verse eid="1JN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inogeleni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11"/>Uno uwo usenga umuhulike songela haichanduso, kamba toinogele wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="1JN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12"/>Sambituwe kamba Kaini yakalile munhu wa Mwenembago, na kamkoma ndugu yake mwenyego Abeli. Habali yamkomile? Kwavija ndugu yake kakala na sang'hano zinogile, ila heyo kakala na sang'hano zihile.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">MWANDUSO 4:8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1JN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, sambimkanganye kamba ulumwengu uhawehila mweye. <verse eid="1JN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14"/>Tuvitanga kamba tubita kulawa muifa na twingila muugima, kwavija toinogela. Munhu yoyose yoleka kumnogela ndugu yake kokala muifa. <verse eid="1JN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15"/>Munhu yoyose yomwihila ndugu yake hiyo mkomaji, na mweye m'vitanga kamba mkomaji kabule ugima wa digunge mgati yake. <verse eid="1JN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16"/>Vino vivo tuimanya nhegulo ya noge, Yesu Kilisto kaulava ugima wake sama yetu, na tweye tolondigwa tuulave ugima wetu sama ya ndugu zetu! <verse eid="1JN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17"/>Kamba munhu yoyose kana vinhu na komona ndugu yake kabule kinhu na ija yali na vinhu hamonela bazi ija yalibule vinhu, noge da Mulungu dokalaze mgati yake? <verse eid="1JN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18"/>Wana wadodo, na tuinogele, si mmulomo tu, ila muikweli na msang'hano.<verse eid="1JN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kugangamala Haulongozi wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19"/>Vino vivo tuvimanya kamba tweye twa wanhu wa kweli na vino vivo vondatuwe bule kidumbo haulongozi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1JN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20"/>Kamba udaho wetu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile uhatudukumiza, tovitanga kamba Mulungu mkulu kubanza udaho wetu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, na kamba kakitanga kila kinhu. <verse eid="1JN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21"/>Wambwiga zangu, kamba udaho wetu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile hautudukumiza, hatuwabule kidumbo haulongozi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1JN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22"/>Na chochose kitupula kumwake, tobokela, kwavija tozigoga ndagizi zake na kugatenda gaja gamnogele heyo. <verse eid="1JN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23"/>Ndagizi yake iyo ino, tumtogole Mwanage yokemigwa Yesu Kilisto na tuinogele kamba vija viyatulagize. <verse eid="1JN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24"/>Awo wozigoga ndagizi za Mulungu woilumba hamoja na heyo, na heyo koilumba hamoja na hewo. Na vino vivo tuvimanya kamba Mulungu koilumba hamoja na tweye, kwavija Loho wa Mulungu iyatugwelele kokala mgati yetu.<verse eid="1JN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Loho wa Ikweli na Loho wa Uvwizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1"/>Wambwiga zangu, sambimtogole kila loho, ila igezeni loho ija mwone kamba ilawa ha Mulungu kwavija wahokozi bwando wa uvwizi walawilila muulumwengu. <verse eid="1JN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2"/>Vino vivo vondamdahe kumtanga Loho wa Mulungu. Kila munhu yotogola kamba Yesu Kilisto keza mulukuli kana Loho wa Mulungu, <verse eid="1JN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3"/>ila kila munhu yolema kumtogola Yesu, halawa ha Mulungu. Ino iyo loho wa m'beza Kilisto, ayo immuhulike kamba kokwiza, na sambi kesha kuvika ka muulumwengu.<verse eid="1JN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4"/>Wana wadodo, mweye mulawa ha Mulungu na mwisha kuwahuma wahokozi wa uvwizi, kwavija yali mgati yenu mkulu kubanza yali mgati ya ulumwengu. <verse eid="1JN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5"/>Hewo wa wanhu wa ulumwengu, avo wolonga gaja golawa muulumwengu na ulumwengu wowategeleza. <verse eid="1JN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6"/>Tweye twa wanhu wa Mulungu, na munhu yoyose yomtanga Mulungu kotutegeleza, na munhu yoyose yalekile kuwa munhu wa Mulungu hatutegeleza. Na vino vivo tumtanga Loho wa ikweli na loho wa uvwizi.<verse eid="1JN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Iyo Noge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7"/>Wambwiga zangu, tuinogele, kwavija noge dolawa ha Mulungu. Kila munhu yali na noge kolawa ha Mulungu na komtanga Mulungu. <verse eid="1JN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8"/>Munhu yoyose yalibule noge hamtanga Mulungu, kwavija Mulungu iyo noge. <verse eid="1JN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9"/>Vino vivo Mulungu viyalaguse noge jake kumwetu, kamtuma Mwanage imwe yaleligwe yeiyeka yeze muulumwengu giladi tuwe na ugima kubitila heyo. <verse eid="1JN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10"/>Dino dijo noge, si kamba tweye tumnogela Mulungu, ila Mulungu katunogela tweye na kamtuma Mwanage yawe nhosa ya kusegeza vilozo vetu.<verse eid="1JN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11"/>Wambwiga zangu, kwavija Mulungu katunogela tweye, na tweye tolondigwa tuinogele wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="1JN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12"/>Haduhu munhu yamonile Mulungu, ila kamba tuhainogela wenyego kwa wenyego, Mulungu kokala mgati yetu, na noge jake domema mgati yetu.<verse eid="1JN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13"/>Tuvitanga kamba tweye tokala mgati yake, na heyo kokala mgati yetu, kwavija katugwelela Loho wake. <verse eid="1JN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14"/>Na tweye tumona na kulava usindila kamba Tata kamtuma Mwanage yawe Mkombola wa ulumwengu. <verse eid="1JN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15"/>Mulungu kokala mgati ya awo wotogola kamba Yesu iyo Mwana wa Mulungu, na wokala mgati ya Mulungu. <verse eid="1JN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16"/>Na tweye wenyego tovitanga na kutogola noge diyalinajo Mulungu kumwetu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Mulungu iyo noge, na awo wali mgati ya idinoge wa mgati ya Mulungu, na Mulungu ka mgati yao. <verse eid="1JN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17"/>Noge dovikizwa mmwetu mnzila ino, kamba hatuwa na kidumbo kuna dizua da nhaguso kwavija kamba vija viyali Kilisto na tweye vivo tuli muulumwengu uno. <verse eid="1JN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18"/>Haduhu kidumbo mdinoge, ila noge dimemelele dowinga kidumbo, kwavija kidumbo chosang'hanika hamoja na nhaguso. Na munhu yoyose yali na kidumbo hanakala goya mdinoge.<verse eid="1JN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19"/>Toinogela kwavija Mulungu kasonga kutunogela tweye. <verse eid="1JN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20"/>Awo wolonga, “Tumnogela Mulungu,” na kipigiti kikija wowehila ndugu zao, wavwizi. Kwavija munhu yoyose yoleka kumnogela ndugu yake yomona, hadaha kumnogela Mulungu yalekile kumona. <verse eid="1JN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21"/>Kilisto katugwelela ndagizi ino ilonga, “Munhu yoyose yomnogela Mulungu vivija kolondigwa yamnogele ndugu yake.”<verse eid="1JN 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuuhuma Ulumwengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1"/>Kila munhu yotogola kamba Yesu iyo Kilisto kowa mwana wa Mulungu, na kila munhu yomnogela Tata vivija kowanogela na wanage. <verse eid="1JN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2"/>Vino vivo tuvitanga kamba towanogela wana wa Mulungu, mkumnogela Mulungu na kuzigoga ndagizi zake. <verse eid="1JN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3"/>Kwavija noge da Mulungu dijo dino, kuzigoga ndagizi zake, na ndagizi zake hazili ndala kumwetu. <verse eid="1JN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4"/>Kwavija kila mwana wa Mulungu kouhuma ulumwengu. Na touhuma ulumwengu kubitila nhamanila. <verse eid="1JN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5"/>Yalihi yondayauhume ulumwengu? Ija tu yotogola kamba Yesu iyo Mwana wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1JN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usindila Woneke ha Yesu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6"/>Yesu Kilisto iyo yezile na mazi ga ubatizo wake na mulopa wa ifa yake, hezile na mazi tu, ila na mazi na mulopa. Na Loho wa Mulungu iyo yolava usindila, kwavija Loho wa Mulungu iyo kweli. <verse eid="1JN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7"/>Kwavija kuna wadatu wolava usindila, <verse eid="1JN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8"/>Loho wa Mulungu, mazi, na mulopa, na wano wose wadatu wolonga kinhu kimwe. <verse eid="1JN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9"/>Toutogola usindila wa kiunhu, ila usindila wa Mulungu mkulu kubanza uja wa kiunhu kwavija ulawa ha Mulungu uyaulavile yomulonga Mwanage. <verse eid="1JN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10"/>Munhu yoyose yomtogola Mwana wa Mulungu kana usindila uno mmoyo wake. Munhu yoyose yoleka kumtogola Mulungu komtenda Mulungu kuwa m'vwizi, kwavija hautogole usindila uyaulavile Mulungu yomulonga Mwanage. <verse eid="1JN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11"/>Na uno uwo usindila, Mulungu katugwelela ugima wa digunge, na ugima uno wa mgati ya Mwanage. <verse eid="1JN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12"/>Munhu yoyose yali hamoja na Mwana kana ugima. Munhu yoyose yalekile kuwa hamoja na Mwana wa Mulungu kabule ugima.<verse eid="1JN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ugima wa Digunge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13"/>Nowandikila mbuli zino mweye mditogola twaga da Mwana wa Mulungu, giladi m'vitange kamba muna ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="1JN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14"/>Uno uwo mgangamalo utulinao mkumkwenhukila Mulungu, kamba tuhapula kinhu chochose kamba vija vuvimnogele heyo, kotuhulika. <verse eid="1JN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15"/>Na kamba tuhavitanga kamba tuhampula kinhu chochose, kotuhulika, vivija tuvitange kamba kotugwelela kija kitumpula.<verse eid="1JN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16"/>Kamba munhu yoyose yahamona ndugu yake kotenda kilozo kileka kugala ifa, yamtambikile, na Mulungu komgwelela ugima munhu hiyo. Mbuli zino nowalongela awo tu wotenda vilozo vileka kugala ifa. Hana vilozo vigala ifa, silonga kamba mtambike sama ya vilozo kamba vino. <verse eid="1JN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17"/>Vilozo nhegulo yake sang'hano zose zihile, na hana vilozo vileka kugala ifa.<verse eid="1JN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18"/>Tuvitanga kamba wanhu wose waleligwe na Mulungu hawagendelela kutenda vilozo, kwavija Mwana wa Mulungu kowemiliza, na Mwenembago hadaha kuwalumiza.<verse eid="1JN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19"/>Tuvitanga kamba tweye twa wana wa Mulungu, na ulumwengu mgima wolongozwa na Mwenembago.<verse eid="1JN 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20"/>Tuvitanga kamba Mwana wa Mulungu keza na kutugwelela utango, avo tumtanga Mulungu wa ikweli, na tokala mgati yake ayo yali kweli mkuilumba hamoja na Mwanage, Yesu Kilisto. Heyo iyo Mulungu wa ikweli youlava ugima wa digunge.<verse eid="1JN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21"/>Wana wadodo, inegeni na miwegu.<verse eid="1JN 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5"/>
</usx>
